		{
			"id": "IbAangifteZzpDetail",
			"route": "/ib-aangifte/aangiften/:id",
			"type": "detail",
			"title": "IB return",
			"config": {
				"register": "shillinq",
				"schema": "IBAangifte",
				"_note": "FINANCIAL / REPORT archetype (native CnDetailPage). An income-tax (IB) return for a sole trader is a tax filing - a signed/submitted document with a lifecycle (CONCEPT -> GEVALIDEERD -> XBRL_GEVALIDEERD -> INGEDIEND -> CORRECTIE_SUPPLETIE) and a Digipoort acknowledgement. Fields carry the P-formulier totals. relatedCollections link to the three schedule schemas that have their own index+detail pages in this fragment (IBOndernemersaftrek, IBLijfrenteAOV, IBBox3Vermogen; all FK taxReturnId) so the preparer can drill into each schedule. KEY: `relatedCollections`, NOT `relatedLists` — `relatedLists` is not a prop on any Cn page component, so it lands in $attrs and renders nothing while every gate stays green (tests/validate-manifest.js now hard-fails on it). TOKEN: `@objectId` — IBAangifte carries no flat business key for a schedule to reference (its payload has enterpriseId/bsn/taxYear but no taxReturnId), so the child FK holds the parent's OpenRegister UUID. Sidebar carries a Documents tab (XBRL/Digipoort source documents) and an Audit Trail tab (immutable filing record, REQ-IB-009). NO comms leaves - a tax return is filed, not discussed.",
				"lifecycleActions": true,
				"relatedCollections": [
					{
						"title": "Entrepreneur allowances",
						"register": "shillinq",
						"schema": "IBOndernemersaftrek",
						"filter": { "taxReturnId": "@objectId" },
						"columns": [
							{ "key": "mkbProfitExemption", "label": "MKB exemption" },
							{ "key": "totalDeduction", "label": "Total deduction" }
						],
						"rowRoute": "IbOndernemersaftrekDetail"
					},
					{
						"title": "Annuity & AOV",
						"register": "shillinq",
						"schema": "IBLijfrenteAOV",
						"filter": { "taxReturnId": "@objectId" },
						"columns": [
							{ "key": "totalDeductible", "label": "Total deductible" }
						],
						"rowRoute": "IbLijfrenteBeheerDetail"
					},
					{
						"title": "Box 3 assets",
						"register": "shillinq",
						"schema": "IBBox3Vermogen",
						"filter": { "taxReturnId": "@objectId" },
						"columns": [
							{ "key": "referenceDate", "label": "Reference date" },
